== Trivia ==
* Tar Boys were added in [[Booster Pack #4]].
* Lumps had a radically different appearance in the original Binding of Isaac.
* {{dlc+|a}} Previously, Lumps appeared as Light Brown in the {{s|Scarred Womb}}. As of [[Booster Packs#Booster Pack #5|Booster Pack #5]], Lumps are now red in this environment.{{dlc-}}
* Tar Boy is a reference to the [https://www.newgrounds.com/portal/view/509092 Newgrounds animation of the same name].

